/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# cargo-apk build artifacts
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks

# Editors
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store

# Kotlin/Java emitted into the APK by build.rs. Glue crates bundle their .kt
# with include_str! and write it here at build time (see copy_kotlin_to in the
# project README), so this is build output, not source. If you hand-write
# Kotlin instead, un-ignore it with a negation such as:
#   !/app/kotlin/com/example/myapp/
/app/kotlin/
